WEBVTT

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:26.500
Calling you my nephew

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:26.500
gives me the creeps.

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:31.580
The last time we met was

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:31.580
a little more than ten years ago.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.700
You hurt me, Kaname.

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:40.790
That body you crushed until

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:40.790
there was no resemblance of me...

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:44.580
It took ten years to restore it.

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:49.120
Well, I guess I should be grateful

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:49.120
to the life force of the Pureblood

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:50.580
that I didn't perish.

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:55.660
Oh, by the way... Now that

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:55.660
my former fiancée Shizuka is gone,

00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:57.870
frankly, I'm breathing

00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:57.870
a sigh of relief.

00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:02.200
If I had waited for her

00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:02.200
to be submissive like this kid's mom,

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:06.330
I think I'd have waited forever.

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:12.790
I'm relieved...that you haven't

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:12.790
changed at all, Uncle.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:19.500
When I kill you,

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:19.500
I won't have to hesitate at all.

00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:25.290
Kaname!

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:29.370
I'm sorry, but I can't

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:29.370
let you hurt Shiki!

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:33.410
I won't sacrifice him

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:33.410
just for the sake of your disputes!

00:01:34.370 --> 00:01:38.410
Can I take it to mean that you're

00:01:34.370 --> 00:01:38.410
on the side of the Senate then?

00:01:40.370 --> 00:01:42.750
Yes, you can.

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:46.500
I see.

00:01:47.910 --> 00:01:51.120
Don't worry.

00:01:47.910 --> 00:01:51.120
Kaname cannot kill me.

00:01:52.830 --> 00:01:55.370
I'll be using this kid's room

00:01:52.830 --> 00:01:55.370
for the time being.

00:01:56.580 --> 00:01:59.330
I'm counting on you,

00:01:56.580 --> 00:01:59.330
Dorm President Kuran.

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:03.580
THE KISS OF THORNS

00:04:05.790 --> 00:04:07.540
Couldn't sleep again?

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:13.040
Yeah... But I'm fine.

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:13.040
Really, it's just lack of sleep.

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:18.830
Hmm? Hey, Akatsuki.

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:20.200
What is it?

00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:21.410
Look.

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:28.950
Shiki? When'd he get back?

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:28.950
And he's with...

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:31.040
Ichiru Kiryu...

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:35.290
What's going on?

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:35.290
Rima, do you--?

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:36.370
I don't know.

00:04:47.870 --> 00:04:50.370
Lover? Kaname Kuran's?

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:51.700
Yes.

00:04:53.120 --> 00:04:57.540
How interesting. And that's why

00:04:53.120 --> 00:04:57.540
he's making them guard her?

00:04:57.950 --> 00:04:59.500
So? My blood?

00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:01.830
I'm sorry.

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:05.500
Sheesh, you're not

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:05.500
very useful, are you?

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:11.080
Well, no matter.

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:11.080
Time is close.

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:14.200
Even if we leave her alone,

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:14.200
in time, that girl will...

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:19.370
I still have work for you.

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:19.370
So do your job well.

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:22.620
Then I'll make

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:22.620
your wish come true too.

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:24.500
Yes.

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:27.660
Please kill those

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:27.660
who caused Shizuka's death.

00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:31.790
I am praying from

00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:31.790
the bottom of my heart...

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:33.700
that your true self

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:33.700
will resurrect itself...

00:05:34.910 --> 00:05:36.500
Lord Rido Kuran.

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:51.660
So, Cross...

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:51.660
how are things with Kuran?

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:54.700
I don't know what you mean...

00:05:56.870 --> 00:06:02.620
Don't cry. Kuran chose Cross.

00:05:56.870 --> 00:06:02.620
We should be happy for them.

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:05.500
Umm...

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:07.250
What a problem.

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:17.040
Are you still involved

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:17.040
with the Senate?

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:20.000
That's none of your business.

00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:23.330
If anything happens...to Yuki...

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:25.790
I won't let you off so easily.

00:06:26.330 --> 00:06:27.330
Scary...

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:42.910
<i>...only blooms once in ten years...</i>

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:47.160
Is something the matter?

00:06:47.700 --> 00:06:48.700
Yuki?

00:06:56.370 --> 00:06:57.580
Hey, Akatsuki!

00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:07.000
Shiki! What's the matter?

00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:07.000
Where've you been until now?

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:11.160
Aren't you bored,

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:11.160
cooped in here by yourself?

00:07:11.500 --> 00:07:12.500
Huh?

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:17.160
Shiki, you...

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:20.160
I have so much time on my hands.

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:23.660
How about it?

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:23.660
Want to have fun together?

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:25.370
Quit fooling around!

00:07:28.250 --> 00:07:31.200
I'm not fooling around.

00:07:28.250 --> 00:07:31.200
I'm serious.

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:35.200
Let me go, Shiki!

00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:45.750
Oh, sorry. I don't have

00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:45.750
total control over my power yet.

00:07:46.830 --> 00:07:52.330
Did that hurt?

00:07:46.830 --> 00:07:52.330
I'll be more gentle next time.

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:56.160
Akatsuki!

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:00.410
Shiki! You bastard!

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:02.700
What were you doing?!

00:08:03.660 --> 00:08:04.950
As you can see...

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:06.950
No, Akatsuki!

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:08.040
Stop!

00:08:09.160 --> 00:08:10.950
Shiki, return to your room!

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:15.000
So...you're ordering me around?

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:20.750
You...

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:23.290
Who do you think

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:23.290
you're talking to?

00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:27.830
Please...go back for now.

00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:31.870
Humph! If you put it like that,

00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:31.870
I guess I have no choice.

00:08:34.250 --> 00:08:35.620
See you later.

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:43.370
Ruka, are you all right?

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:45.870
Yes.

00:08:47.370 --> 00:08:50.200
Takuma...

00:08:47.370 --> 00:08:50.200
What's the matter with Shiki?

00:08:50.870 --> 00:08:55.660
Let me deal with him. And please

00:08:50.870 --> 00:08:55.660
don't say anything to Kaname.

00:08:56.160 --> 00:08:57.160
To Lord Kaname?

00:08:57.660 --> 00:08:58.660
- But...!

00:08:57.660 --> 00:08:58.660
- Kain!

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:06.200
Understood.

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:08.700
Okay, Ruka?

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:10.540
Yes.

00:09:10.910 --> 00:09:12.750
I'm sorry, both of you.

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:22.120
Akatsuki...

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:25.000
Thank you.

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:34.700
What's going on anyway?

00:09:35.950 --> 00:09:38.950
It's no fun meeting

00:09:35.950 --> 00:09:38.950
in school all the time.

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:41.540
Shall we go somewhere tomorrow?

00:09:42.870 --> 00:09:44.910
Kaname...

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:46.620
What is it?

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:50.870
You still haven't answered me!

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:52.250
About what?

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:58.660
Is there some connection

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:58.660
between you and my past?!

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:06.580
Aido told me...

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:06.580
that by making me your lover,

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:08.580
you're trying to protect me.

00:10:11.660 --> 00:10:13.040
From what?

00:10:13.450 --> 00:10:15.080
<i>Trying to protect me</i>

00:10:13.450 --> 00:10:15.080
<i>by making me...?</i>

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:17.500
Is something going to

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:17.500
happen to me?

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:22.330
<i>Then your true feelings towards me...</i>

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:25.160
<i>Those words, "I love you."</i>

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:30.580
Please answer me, Kaname!

00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:35.080
<i>I'm scared...</i>

00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:35.080
<i>So much blood!</i>

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:37.200
Yuki?

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:42.540
<i>I went to see a rose that only</i>

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:42.540
<i>blooms once in ten years.</i>

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:46.830
<i>It's a rose that only blooms</i>

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:46.830
<i>once in ten years preserved in resin.</i>

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:49.950
<i>- No... No!</i>

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:49.950
<i>- Truth... There is only one truth.</i>

00:10:51.200 --> 00:10:52.200
Yuki?

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:56.200
<i>I'm scared!</i>

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:56.200
<i>Help! Help me!</i>

00:10:56.290 --> 00:10:59.870
<i>You cannot run away.</i>

00:10:56.290 --> 00:10:59.870
<i>There's nowhere to run to.</i>

00:11:00.750 --> 00:11:02.870
I...I...!

00:11:03.370 --> 00:11:05.870
Yuki, calm down. Yuki!

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:08.540
<i>- No... No!</i>

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:08.540
<i>- You can't run away.</i>

00:11:08.620 --> 00:11:09.830
<i>You can't run away!</i>

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:11.370
<i>You can't run away!</i>

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:13.200
I don't understand!

00:11:13.660 --> 00:11:15.290
I don't! I don't understand!

00:11:16.040 --> 00:11:18.790
Just who are you to me?!

00:11:19.200 --> 00:11:21.450
Why do you go so far to hide it?!

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:23.950
What happened to me anyway?!

00:11:24.500 --> 00:11:27.830
I...I...for you I...

00:11:36.200 --> 00:11:37.950
Yuki... Yuki!

00:11:39.160 --> 00:11:43.500
K-Kaname...

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:50.080
Why do you look at me...

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:50.080
with such sad eyes?

00:11:53.660 --> 00:12:00.540
It's all right. I will protect you...

00:11:53.660 --> 00:12:00.540
without fail.

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:08.830
Yuki...the time has come at last.

00:12:10.870 --> 00:12:11.870
Juri...

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:17.370
Do I have the strength

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:17.370
to protect her?

00:12:35.160 --> 00:12:36.160
Shiki?

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:40.120
Dorm President is trying to protect

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:40.120
Yuki Cross from something.

00:12:41.160 --> 00:12:46.040
Ichiru Kiryu's transfer,

00:12:41.160 --> 00:12:46.040
then Ichijo and now Shiki...

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:47.660
That guy...

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:49.450
Those eyes...

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:53.040
Is he really Shiki?

00:13:03.830 --> 00:13:07.700
<i>Both of you have had</i>

00:13:03.830 --> 00:13:07.700
<i>many sad experiences...</i>

00:13:08.790 --> 00:13:09.790
<i>Any further...</i>

00:13:14.660 --> 00:13:15.660
Wake up!

00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:21.370
And give your blood...to this monster

00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:21.370
who sleeps in this casket.

00:13:26.830 --> 00:13:31.660
Anytime now...

00:13:26.830 --> 00:13:31.660
Soon, it will be in my possession.

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:36.660
And...I will make a total resurrection.

00:13:41.620 --> 00:13:45.160
That child will awaken

00:13:41.620 --> 00:13:45.160
from her slumber...

00:13:46.120 --> 00:13:49.120
The sweet dreams will

00:13:46.120 --> 00:13:49.120
turn into nightmares.

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:54.040
And its vicious fangs will

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:54.040
destroy her from the inside.

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:57.660
I won't have to lift a finger.

00:13:57.870 --> 00:14:00.160
She will awaken,

00:13:57.870 --> 00:14:00.160
even if I ignore her.

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:02.500
And her blood...

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:07.290
Rido, don't think for a moment

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:07.290
that someone as filthy as you

00:14:07.370 --> 00:14:09.370
can lay a finger on her.

00:14:41.750 --> 00:14:44.870
<i>I want you to stay</i>

00:14:41.750 --> 00:14:44.870
<i>just the way you are, Yuki.</i>

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:49.330
N-No!

00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:50.660
No!

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:18.620
Yuki, are you awake?

00:15:20.950 --> 00:15:21.950
Huh!

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:38.910
Ze...ro...

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:41.290
Are you all right?

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:44.200
Why didn't you resist?

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:50.040
I told you...

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:50.040
you can do anything to me.

00:15:50.830 --> 00:15:53.500
Because...

00:15:50.830 --> 00:15:53.500
you consider me your victim?

00:15:55.410 --> 00:15:57.540
You're wrong, Mr. Nice Guy!

00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:01.160
I'm the one who forced you

00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:01.160
to a place of no return!

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:06.620
I made you follow along

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:06.620
with my whims, Zero!

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:10.290
The reason why I wanted

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:10.290
to be your only ally

00:16:10.370 --> 00:16:13.040
and do whatever I could for you...

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:16.200
That was all for my sake.

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:22.200
I felt that if I became

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:22.200
someone essential to you,

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:25.700
I could say goodbye to

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:25.700
the part of me that had no past.

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:29.620
Yes, it was all for me.

00:16:30.700 --> 00:16:31.700
Otherwise...

00:16:32.700 --> 00:16:36.790
<i>If I become a vampire,</i>

00:16:32.700 --> 00:16:36.790
<i>do you think I would feel stronger?</i>

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:40.660
How could I have said those things,

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:40.660
which were so hurtful to you?

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:43.750
You're not making sense.

00:16:45.160 --> 00:16:49.330
It sounds like you're saying

00:16:45.160 --> 00:16:49.330
you really need me.

00:16:51.830 --> 00:16:54.410
But you're wrong, Yuki.

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:58.500
The one you really need

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:58.500
is Kaname Kuran.

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:02.250
And he's been the one

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:02.250
from long ago, right?

00:17:03.700 --> 00:17:05.500
You're strange.

00:17:11.910 --> 00:17:13.700
I'm sorry, Zero.

00:17:15.290 --> 00:17:16.290
Are you all right?

00:17:16.620 --> 00:17:19.620
Uh-huh. I had a weird dream, and...

00:17:19.700 --> 00:17:21.200
I'm really sorry.

00:17:22.790 --> 00:17:25.040
Oh, you have to go.

00:17:25.250 --> 00:17:27.080
I'm drenched in perspiration

00:17:25.250 --> 00:17:27.080
and I want to change.

00:17:27.790 --> 00:17:29.750
You sure you're all right?

00:17:29.950 --> 00:17:34.700
Yes, I'm fine.

00:17:29.950 --> 00:17:34.700
Thanks. Bye.

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:29.080
Kuran!

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:32.870
What do you really intend

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:32.870
to do with Yuki?

00:18:33.290 --> 00:18:35.250
You cannot betray her.

00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:55.330
Snow...

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:09.580
The world is dyed red...

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:09.580
and it won't go back to normal.

00:19:10.620 --> 00:19:14.750
All I did was do my best

00:19:10.620 --> 00:19:14.750
to remember...

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:18.620
Yuki, it's all right.

00:19:19.290 --> 00:19:24.830
Let's wake you up once...

00:19:19.290 --> 00:19:24.830
before you're broken.

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:38.620
<i>It's cold, but I feel a little hot.</i>

00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:40.950
Huh?!

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:44.080
Kaname...!

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:53.200
<i>Kaname...what is this...</i>

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:53.200
<i>embedded in my neck?</i>

00:20:18.790 --> 00:20:19.790
Yuki...

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:25.660
You, at least you...

00:20:48.540 --> 00:20:49.540
What?!

00:20:49.700 --> 00:20:50.700
That's...

00:20:52.870 --> 00:20:54.120
This smell of blood...

00:20:54.790 --> 00:20:56.700
It...It can't be!

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:06.000
<i>This taste...</i>

00:21:06.830 --> 00:21:08.660
<i>It's Kaname's blood...l?</i>

00:21:18.410 --> 00:21:23.120
Are you awake, Yuki?

00:21:18.410 --> 00:21:23.120
Do you know who I am?

00:21:34.950 --> 00:21:35.950
My...

00:21:41.450 --> 00:21:47.000
I smelled the blood of Yuki...

00:21:41.450 --> 00:21:47.000
which I know very well. And...!

00:21:48.290 --> 00:21:49.290
Zero!

00:21:49.370 --> 00:21:51.200
I sensed two vampires!

00:21:51.450 --> 00:21:53.660
Kuran...

00:21:51.450 --> 00:21:53.660
You turned Yuki into...!

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:54.790
Stop it, Zero!

00:21:55.200 --> 00:21:56.290
This person is...

00:21:57.540 --> 00:22:00.580
...my...brother!

00:22:03.370 --> 00:22:06.830
I'm sorry, Zero.

00:22:14.790 --> 00:22:16.950
Siblings?

00:22:19.330 --> 00:22:25.000
If I had been born her real brother,

00:22:19.330 --> 00:22:25.000
I would have been much happier...

00:23:59.290 --> 00:24:04.250
Next time:

00:23:59.290 --> 00:24:04.250
"Spiraling Recollections"
